  "contentHtml": "<div><div class=\"txc-textbox\" style=\"padding: 10px; border: 3px double rgb(254, 137, 67); background-color: rgb(254, 222, 199);\"><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 19.2px;\"><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"line-height: 25.6px; font-size: 11pt;\"></span></font></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 19.2px;\"><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"line-height: 25.6px; font-size: 11pt;\">&lt;재미있는 과학수업 만들기&gt;의 수업관련자료들은 선생님들의 '협업'을 위해 공유되고 있습니다.</span></font></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 19.2px;\"><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"line-height: 25.6px; font-size: 11pt;\">수업을 위한 자료로만 사용해주시기 바랍니다.&nbsp;</span></font></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 19.2px;\"><b><span style=\"line-height: 1.6; font-size: 11pt;\">** '말머리' 에서 해당단원을 선택해주세요.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"line-height: 1.6; font-size: 18pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">수업자료를 찾기 쉬워집니다.**</span></span></b></p></div><p><br>작년에 선풍이 씻어 넣다가 급히 해 본 색팽이 실험입니다. </p><p>별거를 다하네요~ </p><p>2단원 할 때가 되어 찾아 보니 있네요. 동영상도 촬영한 것 같은데 그건 사라져 버리고.. 사진만 이래..</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/993ADD4C5ACAF8DB19\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"312\" height=\"387\" style=\"width: 312px; height: 387px; clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" data-filename=\"선풍기와 색종이1.jpg\" exif=\"{}\" actualwidth=\"768\"  id=\"A_993ADD4C5ACAF8DB190BF5\"/>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/99CA6C4C5ACAF8DB24\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"319\" height=\"393\" style=\"width: 319px; height: 393px; clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" data-filename=\"선풍기와 색종이 2.jpg\" exif=\"{}\" actualwidth=\"720\"  id=\"A_99CA6C4C5ACAF8DB24C59D\"/></p><p>처음엔 선풍기 날개에 붙여서 했는데 합성이 보이질 않아서 가운데 쪽에 색종이 붙이니 좀 보이더라구요.</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/992C7B4C5ACAF8DB35\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"310\" height=\"410\" style=\"width: 310px; height: 410px; clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" data-filename=\"빨파합성.jpg\" exif=\"{}\" actualwidth=\"720\"  id=\"A_992C7B4C5ACAF8DB35E85E\"/>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/9943B94C5ACAF8DC33\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"302\" height=\"411\" style=\"width: 302px; height: 411px; clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" data-filename=\"빨초합성.jpg\" exif=\"{}\" actualwidth=\"720\"  id=\"A_9943B94C5ACAF8DC33EA20\"/></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/992DF64C5ACAF8DC33\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"308\" height=\"361\" style=\"width: 308px; height: 361px; clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" data-filename=\"초파합성.jpg\" exif=\"{}\" actualwidth=\"720\"  id=\"A_992DF64C5ACAF8DC33EC77\"/>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp; <img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/99BBDE4C5ACAF8DC26\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"306\" height=\"358\" style=\"width: 306px; height: 358px; clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" data-filename=\"빨파초합성.jpg\" exif=\"{}\" actualwidth=\"720\"  id=\"A_99BBDE4C5ACAF8DC269A14\"/></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>순서대로 빨파합성, 빨초합성, 초파합성, 빨파초합성입니다.</p></div>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->"
